<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42014" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rumpōtĭnus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		rumpus-teneo. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>That serves to support the running vines</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">genus arbusti Gallici,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					5, 7, 1</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">also arbores,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 5, 7, 1, § 3</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rumpōtĭnus</span></b> ,
				i,f., <i>a kind of
			maple</i> (opulus), <i><span class="en">Plin. 14, 1, 3, § 12</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">24, 19, 112,
				§ 172</span></i>. 
			</div>
